    "name": "Is an Open-Concept Kitchen Remodel Right for Your San Diego County Home?",
    "text": "Is an Open-Concept Kitchen Remodel Right for Your San Diego County Home?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "An open-concept kitchen remodel is worthwhile when the improved layout, visibility, storage, and connection to adjacent living areas solve meaningful daily problems, and when the required structural, utility, ventilation, and permitting work fits the home and budget. It may be less suitable when the existing structure, limited storage, cooking habits, or project scope make the tradeoffs unacceptable.",
